SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #6: Mount Royal Roller
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nNote: Hike on Monday this week. If
  there are thunderstorms\, the hike will cancel at 5 pm.\n\nRating: Strenu
 ous for Elevation Gain\nDistance: 5 miles\nPace: 3.2 mph\nElevation Gain: 
 1000\, in the first 1.5 miles.\nSurface: Road\nDogs: On leash\nBears: Poss
 ible\nRoute:\n[https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/mt-royal-loop-565767e
 ](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/mt-royal-loop-565767e)\n\nScenic A
 sheville Series: There are 9 hikes in the series\; hike them all and recei
 ve an [attractive](https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxo
 dlk4ZPeCCgqZrWK2EUJvk_vI/edit?usp=drivesdk) badge for your backpack. Check
  your progress [HERE](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKI
 i8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk/edit?usp=drivesdk).\n\nRSVP and On-Time St
 art:\n\n*If you decide you cannot come\, please change your RSVP status to
  "Not Going" as soon as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notic
 e.\n\n**Guests:** If you bring a guest or plus one\, please make sure they
  are fit enough to make the climb 🪜 - this is the most strenuous hike i
 n the series.\n\nDisclaimer and Release of Liability:\nThis activity invol
 ves hiking on city streets that may have traffic. Participants are respons
 ible for their safety on streets and trails. The organizer of this trip is
  a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of the organizer i
 s only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event 
 you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks 
 of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and 
 associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree t
 o the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/
 terms)\nRead less
